WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.589 --> 00:01:03.401
song The pals saw Luke.

2
00:01:05.862 --> 00:01:07.023
He sat on the mule.

3
00:01:08.904 --> 00:01:10.985
Pink: It's so cute!

4
00:01:11.705 --> 00:01:13.366
Can I sit on the mule?

5
00:01:13.386 --> 00:01:15.988
Luke: No!

6
00:01:18.169 --> 00:01:19.210
Pink was sad.

7
00:01:27.414 --> 00:01:29.255
Look! I see a cube!

8
00:01:31.628 --> 00:01:32.689
There is a tube!

9
00:01:32.709 --> 00:01:36.271
Yellow: I see cups!

10
00:01:36.811 --> 00:01:41.174
Blue: I see pots and lids.

11
00:01:44.817 --> 00:01:49.780
Green: Let's play a tune!

12
00:01:54.443 --> 00:01:55.764
The pals played a tune.

13
00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:07.462
But the tune was not good!

14
00:02:07.482 --> 00:02:11.586
Luke: Stop!

15
00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:14.369
That's a bad tune!

16
00:02:16.731 --> 00:02:18.173
Luke hid in the cube.

17
00:02:21.276 --> 00:02:28.784
Green: Let's play again.

18
00:02:50.352 --> 00:02:52.357
Luke: That's a nice tune!
